Here is a `.gitignore` suited for the Solar PV Defect Detection project (Python + data/ML + Streamlit + Docker).  

```gitignore
# -------------------------------------------------
# Python / general
# -------------------------------------------------
# Byte‑compiled / optimized / C extensions
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Cython compiled files
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.egg
*.whl

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

# Unit test / coverage reports
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover

# Pytest cache
.pytest_cache/
# MyPy cache
.mypy_cache/
# Type checking
.pyre/
# Linting cache
.flake8
ruff_cache/
# StaticHere is a `.gitignore` suited for the Solar PV Defect Detection project (Python + data/ML + Streamlit + Docker).  

```gitignore
# -------------------------------------------------
# Python / general
# -------------------------------------------------
# Byte‑compiled / optimized / C extensions
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Cython compiled files
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.egg
*.whl

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

# Unit test / coverage reports
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover

# Pytest cache
.pytest_cache/
# MyPy cache
.mypy_cache/
# Type checking
.pyre/
# Linting cache
.flake8
ruff_cache/
# Static analysis
.bandit

# PyCharm / VS Code / IDE files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
*.vscode/
*.code-workspace
*.iml

# Jupyter / IPython
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb

# -------------------------------------------------
# Data / model artifacts (large, generated, or private)
# -------------------------------------------------
# Synthetic / raw dataset (can be regenerated)
data/raw/
# Real ELPV dataset (downloaded from Kaggle – large)
data/elpv/
# Processed data / intermediate files
data/processed/
# Model checkpoints and trained weights
static/models/
# Visualisation outputs
static/visualizations/
# Generated reports / PDFs
*.pdf
# Archive / zip of the project (avoid committing the built zip)
*.zip

# -------------------------------------------------
# Environment / secrets
# -------------------------------------------------
# Virtual environment directories
venv/
.env/
env/
# Condaa environment files
*.condaa/
# Environment variable files
.env*
# Secrets / API keys
kaggle.json
*.key
*.pem

# -------------------------------------------------
# Logs / runtime files
# -------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
*.out
*.err

# -------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor specific
# -------------------------------------------------
# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Linux
*~
.nfs*

# -------------------------------------------------
# Miscellaneous
# -------------------------------------------------
# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo

# End of .gitignore
```